docs {
  # Collections

  A collection is a reader-curated shelf or list (`To Read in 2027`, `My Favourites`). A book may
  be in several collections, and a collection may be empty. Names are unique per reader among
  active collections, ignoring case, spacing and Unicode composition.

  Run the folder in order. **Register collections reader** creates its own disposable account and
  the folder creates its own books, so it is independent of every other folder.
  Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Categories and collections").
}
